lights Egypt's ancient marine environments hidden beneath its deserts.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/14-fossilised-teeth-found-in-egypts-ancient-shark-graveyard-reveal-five-extinct-species-from-the-age-of-dinosaurs/articleshow/133540213.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/14-fossilised-teeth-found-in-egypts-ancient-shark-graveyard-reveal-five-extinct-species-from-the-age-of-dinosaurs/articleshow/133540213.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-26T18:50:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133540618,imgsize-281812.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[This prehistoric Czech sanctuary is 1,000 years older than Stonehenge]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133537380.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/this-prehistoric-czech-sanctuary-is-1000-years-older-than-stonehenge-reveals-how-farmers-tracked-the-movements-of-the-sun-and-the-moon-6500-years-ago/articleshow/133537380.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/this-prehistoric-czech-sanctuary-is-1000-years-older-than-stonehenge-reveals-how-farmers-tracked-the-movements-of-the-sun-and-the-moon-6500-years-ago/articleshow/133537380.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-26T17:20:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133537380,imgsize-243591.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Australia to hand-vaccinate 5,000 wild penguins against bird flu]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" s